OL,3,GNEWSAShorter showers suggested to save
OL,4,Awater
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water is urging customers to
OL,7,Fmake small adjustments to their daily
OL,8,Froutines to help save water.
OL,10,FThe utility has issued a hosepipe ban
OL,11,Facross Devon, Cornwall, the Isles of
OL,12,FScilly and parts of Dorset and Somerset
OL,13,Fto help deal with the prolonged dry
OL,14,Fweather.
OL,16,FIt has now advised customers to turn
OL,17,Ftaps off while brushing their teeth,
OL,18,Fkeeping showers to four minutes and
OL,19,Fwatering plants with a watering can
OL,20,Ffirst thing to help further.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
