OL,3,GNEWSAShorter showers suggested to save
OL,4,Awater
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater efficiency manager Megan Williams
OL,7,Fsaid it was "important we all work
OL,8,Ftogether to be more water aware and
OL,9,Fbuild more resilience whatever the
OL,10,Fweather".
